---
layout: base.njk
description: A robotics engineering textbook for software developers, from first principles to simulated projects and field engineering.
---
{% set notes = collections.notes | sort(attribute="data.order") %}
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal"></span> THE ROBOTICS NOTEBOOK</p>
    <h1 id="intro">Robotics from first principles.</h1>
    <p>No robotics background required. Start with a Python robot loop, then work through motion, sensing, autonomy, deployment, and the practice of building reliable robots.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button" href="/notes/start-here/">Start here <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/notes/robotics-career-roadmap/">Explore career paths</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figure class="diagram">
    <img src="/assets/arm.svg" width="560" height="342" alt="Schematic of a two-joint arm with a base coordinate frame and an end-effector coordinate frame.">
    <figcaption><span>FIG. 01</span> PLANAR ARM / FRAME SKETCH</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<section class="library" id="notes" aria-labelledby="library-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">BOOK INDEX / {{ notes | length }} CHAPTERS</p>
      <h2 id="library-title">Table of contents</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Read the common core, then choose a role and build a project.</p>
  </div>
  <nav class="track-nav" aria-label="Book parts">
    {% for track in tracks %}
    <a href="#{{ track.id }}">{{ track.title }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </nav>
  {% for track in tracks %}
  <section class="track" id="{{ track.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ track.id }}-title">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">PART {{ track.number }}</p>
      <h3 id="{{ track.id }}-title">{{ track.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ track.outcome }}</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="note-grid">
      {% for note in notes %}
      {% if note.data.topic in track.topics %}
      <li>
        <a class="card" href="{{ note.url }}">
          <span class="card-top"><span class="eyebrow">{{ note.data.order | escape }}{% if note.data.minutes %} / {{ note.data.minutes }} MIN{% endif %}</span><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
          <h4>{{ note.data.title | escape }}</h4>
          <p>{{ note.data.description | escape }}</p>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
